{"scope":"rt-8772aac802","css":".rt-8772aac802 p.MsoNormal, .rt-8772aac802 li.MsoNormal, .rt-8772aac802 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-8772aac802 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251656704;left:-80px;\r\ntop:12px;width:1045px;height:15px'><img width=836 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhFQQDAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQAVBAEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8dyAxQAOw==\"><\/span><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>U S G\r\nDOPPLER STUDY OF PENILE<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both\r\nright and left corpora cavernosum and corpora spongiosum appears normal\r\nhomogeneous.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The right and left\r\ncavernosal arteries appears homogeneous with no occlusion is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The flacid state\r\nboth the arteries are measuring 1.2 &amp; 1.4 mm. at the right and left\r\nrespectively.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The tunica\r\nadventitia appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>Deep dorsal vein\r\nappears normal and collapsed.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>Penile urethra is\r\npoorly visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>No fibrotic\r\nstrands are noted in the cavernosum or in spongiosum area.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The both\r\ncavernosal arteries spectral pattern showing monophasic wave form with systolic\r\nflow.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The peak systolic\r\nvelocity both the cavernosal arteries are 14 cm\/sec. and 17 cm\/sec.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>26G hypodermic\r\nneedle 30mg. papavarine is injected at root of corpora cavernosum and phases of\r\narterial spectra was taken in 20min. of duration till the flacid state.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The post injection\r\nthere is slight fall of peak systolic velocity in both cavernosal artery\r\nmeasuring 17 and 22 cm\/sec. In right and left respectively with gradual\r\nincreasing of the peak systolic velocity noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>At 5min. peak\r\nsystolic velocity is about 23 and 27 cm\/sec. both cavernosal artery\r\nrespectively with broadening of the peak systolic spectra. The helicine\r\narteries are engorged and showing forward cavernosal filling.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>There is gradual\r\nincrease of the cavernosal artery spectra with gradual fall of the diastolic\r\nflow with almost nil diastolic flow at the 20 min. phase with loss of deep\r\ndorsal venous flow pattern. The peak erection sustain for 15min. and than fall\r\ninto the flacid state, the 30min. post injection with the peak systolic flow\r\nmeasuring 11 cm\/sec. and 10 cm\/sec. respectively in both cavernosal artery.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>No AV malformation\r\nfistula are noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>The visual index\r\nof Penile erection in E2.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=576\r\n style='border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=336 valign=top style='width:252.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>REG.NO.\u00a0 : L2007<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=240 valign=top style='width:180.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><b><span lang=EN-US>M.N.D.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=336 valign=top style='width:252.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>PATIENT : QUTUBUDDIN MALL