ign=top style='width:74.4pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.3pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=18 valign=top style='width:13.45pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.3pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NORMAL PENILE VASCULAR FLOW PATTERN WITH MODERATE\r\nERECTILE PATTERN AND NO VASCULAR ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION IS DEMONSTRATED POST\r\nINJECTION. NORMAL REVERSAL INTO THE FLACID STATE IS OBTAINED WITH NORMAL\r\nMONOPHASIC ARTERIAL SPECTRA<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>---PLEASE CORRELATE CLINICALLY.\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>S.B.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658752;left:-80px;\r\ntop:414px;width:1045px;height:416px'><img width=836 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhFQQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAVBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJVhI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8dPANB2jd96zu9+D\/wJg8ShsYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9yttwv+isPksbmMPqvT7LW7DX9fCwA7\"><\/span><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>USG\r\nDOPPLER OF PENIS<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Clinical profile: Follow up case of penile\r\nfracture on follow up.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nInitial USG study of flaccid penis shows residual oedema around.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Alignment between bulbospongiosum and\r\ncorpora cavernosa well preserved.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Doppler study penis shows uniphasic flow\r\nwithin cavernosal artery with dampened diastolic flow.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>After ingestion of 50 mg. Sildenafil and\r\nscanning between 15-13 minutes, cavernosal artery shows mild increase in peak\r\nflow with no increase in diastolic flow \u2013 associated mild congestion both\r\ncorpora seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US>B Mode :<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Two corpora cavernosa and one corpora\r\nsporgiosa is noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>No plaque \/ calcification in tunica\r\nalbuginea\u00a0 \/ buck\u2019s fascia seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Diameters of cavernosal arteries on both\r\nsides is 0.87 mm.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US>Doppler : <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>The PSV of cavernosal artery on both side\r\nis <u>Post papaverine injection\u00a0 -<\/u> 16 cm\/s<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US>B Mode :<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Engorged sirmsoids of corpus cavernosa are\r\nnoted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Increased diameter of the cavernosal\r\narteries is noted (1.56 mm).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Doppler :<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>The PSV in cavernosal artery at 20 min is\r\n53.57 cm\/s (&gt;35cm\/s) _____ out possibility of arterial insufficiency. No\r\nvenous insufficiency is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Mild post procedural changes is seen in the\r\nshaft of the penis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>No other significant abnormality seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Doppler and B mode study of bilateral\r\ntestes are normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Impression :<br>\r\nFollow up case of penile shaft fracture.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>B Mode and Doppler study are in normal\r\nlimits .<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Post procedural changes are seen in the\r\nshaft of the penis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>--Needs clinical correlation.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"153.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 45.0pt"}}